1
00:05:54,285 --> 00:06:00,285
The Guernsey Literary & Potato Peel Pie Society is a romance,
drama, history film directed by Mike Newell.

2
00:11:48,571 --> 00:11:54,571
Free-spirited writer Juliet Ashton forms a life-changing bond with the delightful and eccentric Guernsey Literary and Potato Peel
Pie Society, when she decides to write about the book club they formed during the occupation of Guernsey in WWII.

3
00:17:42,857 --> 00:17:48,857
Juliet Ashton, played by Lily James.

4
00:23:37,142 --> 00:23:43,142
Elizabeth McKenna, played by Jessica Brown Findlay.

5
00:29:31,428 --> 00:29:37,428
Sidney Stark, played by Matthew Goode.

6
